HOL `EVAL` of `memcpy_code`, `clear_top_inst`, `SetNewTrigger` and `word_gc_code`
for each `gc_kind` (64-bit, plus a 32-bit generational row), and of `prog_comp`
and `compile` on two programs (the `Seq`, `If`, `Loop`, `Alloc`, both `StoreConsts`,
non-returning `Call` and returning `Call` with a handler clauses of `comp`).  Each printed HOL
term is translated constructor for constructor (overload names to the tagged
overload ports) and compared by `rfl`, or by `simp` with the equation lemmas of
the well-founded `next_lab`/`comp`.
-/

